00:00:03.439 --> 00:00:05.190 align:start position:0%
 
how i run my twitter chats  so every month i create a new twitter  chat with dell  where i'm answering questions from  entrepreneurs we pick a specific topic  it may be  how to find your passion how to stay  motivated how to get your first customer  and you basically have me for an hour on  twitter to  talk about that subject ask me whatever  question you have  help answer questions from other people  and we get so much feedback and comments  on all the twitter chats  that one of the participants who who i  know here in toronto local  and city entrepreneur mark elwood wrote  in to ask me a couple questions about  them so he wrote in to say  hi evan i attended the first bit of your  motivational chat last week  then got onto a business development  call that went right through the chat i  reviewed a few of the tweets afterwards  looked like there were some good  conversations thanks for the inspiring  ideas  his first question was do you have many  of the tweets pre-written  so mark i don't what i do with the  pre-written tweets there's twofold  one are i will invite everybody to the  chat so people who  participated in last month's chat i'll  tweet them in advance usually the day  before and say hey just a reminder  tomorrow we're doing our next chat  i'd love to have you join in on it and  that is a pre-tweet that  it's recorded and set usually to go like  at five minute intervals  during the actual chat there's only one  series of quotes that i have pre-written  and they're from michael dell  i love michael dell man michael dell  such an inspiration to a lot of  entrepreneurs and i'm really fortunate  to work with a company like dell  where they have an inspirational leader  so many of the companies  you have no idea who their leader or  their founder is they don't do a good  job telling their story  but michael dow gets entrepreneurship  and he he started his business  with a thousand dollars and a dream and  he had to tell his parents  i don't want to become a doctor like you  want me to become i want to start my own  business  and and he had to prove them wrong and  so i love his story i love all his  advice  and i will take out a few of his quotes  that i love that i feel motivated  inspired by and schedule those  out throughout the chat usually at five  minute intervals so  the chats from 12 30 to 1 30 it will  should be like 12 35  12 40 12 45 there'll be a new michael  dell quote  that is scheduled out everything else  isn't everything else is crazy  uh by the time i log on to the chat  there's usually already a whole pile of  questions  i'll answer the first one that dell puts  out and then the rest is me  like mad typing away answering questions  and uh and it goes until the hours up  and  and beyond so i wish there may be was a  way to schedule those out but it's fun  having the live interaction and and  that's me that's not my assistant that's  not  anybody on my team when i post from my  twitter account  that's me that's my voice those are my  words and it's all live  and that's what makes the twitter chat  really fun his next question was  do you have some sort of tool that  easily breaks your comments into 140  characters including a hashtag  so for most twitter chats to work they  have some hashtag for us  it's dell smb chat  and so that's included at the end of  every tweet  that gets put up in the chat there's no  tool that i use to break down  uh my thoughts into 140 characters  it's it's practice  you know it's a mindset it's now not  writing for  a blog but writing for twitter it's  something  that you get better at it's a discipline  it's  trying to think in terms of 140  characters  right and most of my tweets are also in  response to other people so i have to  factor in  their handles too so i got the their  handles i have the hashtag and then i  only have  that much space for my thoughts it's  just practicing being more concise  and as i've done more and more on  twitter you get better at it just like  anything else any other skill  you practice getting better at it and  and you will and his last question was  one final thing i only use a regular  twitter home page to follow  conversations  it's not that easy 19 new comments  arrive and you have to scroll down to  see the newest of the bunch  what add-on do you use so i love using a  tool called twitter fall  and why i love it is it'll show you all  the posts that come in with the hashtag  and it will pause as you're going along  and if you're responding to somebody it  pauses and then after you stop  responding the new ones start flowing  and so if you go to twitter fall and you  use whatever hashtag you're trying to  follow along with  it makes it super easy to see the  conversations that are coming in  and respond to people it also is a great  tool for  showing on conferences or big tvs if  you're putting on an event  you can load up twitter fall and put  whatever hashtag and as people respond  it'll show up  on the screen so it's great for display  purposes too  totally free i'm a big fan i have no  involvement in the company other than  being a happy user  the guys at dell use hootsuite and  i use hootsuite too to do the pre-tweets  i use hootsuite on a daily basis to  manage my twitter account and you find  all power twitter users  they're not using the twitter homepage  they're using other tools hootsuite's  one of the most common ones  and you can set up a new list using that  search term  whatever the hashtag is that you're  you're using and it'll show up on there  as you go through  i've been trying to get them to move  towards twitter fall uh  we'll see we'll see what happens but  those are the tools that we use twitter  follow and hootsuite  so thanks mark for the great questions  hopefully that helped for those of you  who are interested in checking out the  twitter chats and being involved i'd  love to have you it's always a fun time  you can check out uh the upcoming chats  at  evancomica.com twitter with the  lowercase  or everything lowercase and i'll see you  in the next chat  believe for those who watching like the  video you can subscribe to the channel  see more videos just like this thank you  so much  i'll see you soon  you

